<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Totta cuts prime to 10.875 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco Totta cuts prime to 10.875 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Totta &amp; Acores (BTA) said on Tuesday it had cut its prime lending rate 0.375 of a percent to 10.875 percent, effective from January 2.</p>
<p>The move brings it into line with other major banks whose rates for leading corporate customers range from 10.750 to 10.875 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
